// Official Recurly logo, stored as a run-length-encoded alpha mask.
//
// Async texture loading (TextureLoader, <img> + canvas, even a data: URI) all
// resolve here but never make it into the captured frame, so the logo silently
// never drew. An RLE mask decodes synchronously during the first render, which
// puts the brand mark on the exact same code path as every other card face.
//
// Sized to out-resolve its on-screen footprint at the 2160x2700 master. The
// public source art is only 206x46, so it is Lanczos-upscaled and then
// edge-restored with a sigmoidal curve — the mark is effectively bilevel, so
// this recovers crisp letterforms instead of shipping soft interpolation.
export const RECURLY_W = 1792;
export const RECURLY_H = 448;
export const RECURLY_ALPHA_RLE =
  '';
